<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="emblems">Emblems of Triumph for Marksmanship Hunter DPS Phase 3</h3>In phase 3 all of your item level 232 and 245 tier 9 pieces of gear cost <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47241/emblem-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></a>. With that said, you are limited by how many <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47241/emblem-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></a> you can acquire every week and you also need <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47242/trophy-of-the-crusade">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_trophy_argent.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Trophy of the Crusade</span></a> so it is recommended you save you your emblems for the 245 tier 9 versions and skip the 232 versions altogether as the 245 versions will provide a lot more value due to the emblem cost. <br/>
<br/>Due to the fact that tier 9 requires <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47241/emblem-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></a> in phase 3 I highly recommend you do not spend any of your emblems on non-tier items. Only after you have purchased your four tier tokens should you spend excess <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47241/emblem-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></a> on <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47556/crusader-orb">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_rune.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Crusader Orb</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>Tier 9 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48272/windrunners-headpiece-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_100.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Windrunner's Headpiece of Triumph</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48270/windrunners-spaulders-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_100.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Windrunner's Spaulders of Triumph</span></a> are the two biggest immediate upgrades coming into Phase 3 so focus on those two pieces of gear first.<br/>
