<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Marksmanship Hunter DPS Phase 3</h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="head">Head for Marksmanship Hunter DPS Phase 3</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48267/windrunners-headpiece-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_100.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Windrunner's Headpiece of Triumph</span></a> is the best option available in phase 3. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45610/boundless-gaze">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_92.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Boundless Gaze</span></a> is still an exceptional head piece to use in the mean time and will last a considerable time into the phase until you obtain 2/<wbr/>4 piece tier 9. If you are in a more hardcore guild that will be clearing hardmode and tribute chests right away then <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45610/boundless-gaze">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_92.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Boundless Gaze</span></a> will last you until you obtain your <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48267/windrunners-headpiece-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_100.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Windrunner's Headpiece of Triumph</span></a>. <br/>
<br/>Depending on your own guilds loot situation, and your own personal <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47241/emblem-of-triumph">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></a> amount I would consider skipping <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=48272/windrunners-headpiece-of-triumph">
