<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="waist">Waist for Marksmanship Hunter DPS Phase 3</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47472/waistguard-of-deathly-dominion">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_45a.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Waistguard of Deathly Dominion</span></a> is a significant upgrade in phase 3 and will be one of your important pieces of gear to acquire for hit cap. You can also work towards the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47311/waistguard-of-deathly-dominion">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_45a.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Waistguard of Deathly Dominion</span></a> (25 normal) version of the belt for a very minor upgrade over <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46095/soul-devouring-cinch">
