<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="trinkets">Trinkets for Marksmanship Hunter DPS Phase 3</h3>In phase 3 your two best trinkets are <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47464/deaths-choice">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bone_skull_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Death's Choice</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45931/mjolnir-runestone">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_rune_11.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mjolnir Runestone</span></a>. Hopefully you have been lucky in Phase two and already have your <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45931/mjolnir-runestone">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_rune_11.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mjolnir Runestone</span></a>. If not then you will need to continue running 10man <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4273/ulduar">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Ulduar</span></a>.  <br/>
<br/>the 25man normal version <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47303/deaths-choice">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bone_skull_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Death's Choice</span></a> is a minor upgrade over <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46038/dark-matter">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_seedofdestruction.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dark Matter</span></a>, however keep in mind that you can <b>not</b> equip both <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47464/deaths-choice">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bone_skull_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Death's Choice</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47303/deaths-choice">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bone_skull_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Death's Choice</span></a> together so if you already have the 25man heroic version do not take the 25man version from anyone.<div class="pad"></div>
