<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_halberd_31.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hellion Glaive</span></a> should be feral druid priority first. <br/>
<br/>
